==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Heliolisk|99}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Rear Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Rapidash|44}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
